{"id":3242,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p><br></p><p><a></a>11 月 11 日下午，概率统计系在9号楼924会议室举行本学期第二次《概率论与数理统计》集体备课教学交流活动，围绕“数理统计相关内容的探讨”的主题进行，凝聚教学共识。活动由杨丽老师主持，雷英杰老师主讲，课程全体任课教师参会。</p><p>会上，雷英杰老师分享了数理统计部分的教学方法与思路。讲解最大似然估计原理时，他巧妙融入课程思政元素，实现知识传授与价值引领并重；阐释假设检验原理时，通过逼真直观的图像化呈现，将抽象理论转化为易懂内容，获在场教师认可。随后，杨丽老师就期末考试安排、学习通题库建设等工作作详细说明。参会教师围绕教学疑点、难点展开热烈讨论，交流教学经验、共商解决方案。</p><p>此次集体备课搭建了互学互鉴的平台，老师们集思广益、取长补短，有效整合教学资源、凝聚教学智慧。大家表示将把交流成果转化为教学实践，持续优化教学方法，助力课程教学质量稳步提升。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nzvaZU8-iMRLYMPmvZnRWkMzGsnRrY2ozQ2MmGiL4CsolC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyboSybn1hRMR98MzvPLzLYolr7Mm6RU4-DnN-DoRGsnzQFnln7UN74LzfFMmUYn1b/v2rjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4liLzvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5517&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9999FC4845711329ED67CC26FB6807E6/EDDBA310/642F\" vheight=\"267\" vwidth=\"475\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0nzvaZU8-iMRLYMPmvZnRWkMzGsnRrY2ozQ2MmGiL4CsolC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyboSybn1hRMR98MzvPLzLYolr7Mm6RU4-DnN-DoRGsnzQFnln7UN74LzfFMmUYn1b/v2rjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4liLzvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5517&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0UlUaYnRliLRQRnPzU4nRrkLRQ7nRWY2U4CDUz9an7VkL8-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8oSysL1hVnmQ7nR67UmNsolCiMNLbM7M2MRNiL4nfolVFnlMknRlZnlrFMzv8M1b/v2rjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4liLzvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5517&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/54972EF6DD7DB979F56C94CF49534A9A/ECBD58EE/5746\" vheight=\"263\" vwidth=\"468\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0UlUaYnRliLRQRnPzU4nRrkLRQ7nRWY2U4CDUz9an7VkL8-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8oSysL1hVnmQ7nR67UmNsolCiMNLbM7M2MRNiL4nfolVFnlMknRlZnlrFMzv8M1b/v2rjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4liLzvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5517&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0L4-aPUNC4oRA7MPzVkM7C8M4NbU8QYRnmNDozUPL4-iUl70gihFp2hmCIa0okyiLSyZM1hRLRQkM8MfLm9Yn7UPLmvaMlQRUNLiUmNPLlMFL8CZUNlsnzfFMRGiokb/v2rjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4liLzvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5517&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/85186C06B7CA282DD12705FC